WEBVTT

1

00:01:56.167 --> 00:02:00.250

At last, there's nobody here but us.



2

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.875

Father...



3

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:04.833

Sorry to make you wait.



4

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.125

Listen, Historia...



5

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:12.667

This may sound very strange to you,

but Frieda is not entirely dead.



6

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:14.083

Eh?



7

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:17.583

The memories of Frieda still live on.



8

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:21.208

Would you like to meet your sister?



9

00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.583

Yes!



10

00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:33.958

Understand, Eren?!



11

00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:37.792

You'll be the one to avenge your mother!



12

00:02:49.458 --> 00:02:50.792

They got in?



13

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.333

That's...



14

00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:59.250

What are those?



15

00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:04.750

Fire arrow?



16

00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:10.958

Gunpowder?!



17

00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:16.375

By the burning pattern, they must

have scattered bags full of oil...



18

00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:17.875

This could get ugly!



19

00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:21.917

Here they come!



20

00:03:21.917 --> 00:03:23.417

Shoot 'em down!



21

00:03:25.917 --> 00:03:27.292

Smoke signal shells?!



22

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:32.417

Tsk! We'll never hit a thing in all this smoke.



23

00:03:34.292 --> 00:03:36.125

Twenty-four.



24

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:38.083

Thirty-two.



25

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:39.708

Thirty-five enemies!



26

00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:42.458

They're gathered behind the pillars!



27

00:03:42.458 --> 00:03:43.833

Continue the plan!



28

00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:46.083

We'll take 'em all out right here!



29

00:03:46.083 --> 00:03:49.583

All troops, spread out!

Surround them one at a time!



30

00:03:58.667 --> 00:04:00.417

More smoke?!



31

00:04:00.417 --> 00:04:02.750

Shit! Where'd they go?!



32

00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:08.542

A big weakness of the

Anti-Personnel ODM gear is...



33

00:04:08.542 --> 00:04:14.208

...their line of fire and anchor trajectory

are both faced in the same direction.



34

00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:19.458

In other words, the area directly behind

them is completely out of their reach.



35

00:04:30.542 --> 00:04:32.583

Over there! Fire!



36

00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:37.625

I missed?!



37

00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:38.875

Where are they?!



38

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:45.250

You're mine!



39

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:53.792

Sasha!



40

00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:57.167

Conny! Hide in the smoke and fight!



41

00:04:58.458 --> 00:04:59.792

Take this!



42

00:05:03.375 --> 00:05:04.625

Shit!



43

00:05:05.625 --> 00:05:10.042

But their greatest weakness is...

once they've fired off two shots...



44

00:05:11.083 --> 00:05:14.333

...it takes a while for them to reload.



45

00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:20.500

This ain't looking good.



46

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.417

The hell's with that girl?!



47

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:34.125

When they manage to get this close,

swords have the advantage!



48

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.208

We've gotta stop 'em!



49

00:05:44.917 --> 00:05:47.667

At this rate, we'll get wiped out!



50

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:58.042

Yo, Levi.



51

00:05:58.042 --> 00:06:01.917

Not that I've got time to waste on you, but...



52

00:06:01.917 --> 00:06:05.708

If you get past here, it'll all be for nothin'.



53

00:06:07.958 --> 00:06:12.625

So be it. Guess I'll have to play.



54

00:06:12.625 --> 00:06:15.083

Neener, neener, neener!



55

00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:23.375

You're a spunky one, damn.



56

00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:27.833

Tsk!



57

00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:43.583

Not sick of playing yet? Good grief.



58

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.958

Didn't I teach you?!



59

00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:51.667

When chasing an enemy,

don't just stare straight ahead!



60

00:06:56.917 --> 00:06:58.625

Over here, dimwit!



61

00:07:20.417 --> 00:07:22.708

You... bastard.



62

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.625

That really hurt!



63

00:07:28.625 --> 00:07:32.083

If I can force one of them

to show a small opening...



64

00:07:38.167 --> 00:07:42.708

Huh? Both of your shots were way off!



65

00:07:42.708 --> 00:07:45.833

You like to live recklessly, too?!



66

00:07:51.167 --> 00:07:52.375

Argh!



67

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.083

Hange!



68

00:08:10.792 --> 00:08:14.750

Now! Fall back to the final defensive post!



69

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.375

Time to regroup!



70

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:22.708

Tsk!



71

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.500

Stay out of the way, you little runt.



72

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.167

Ouch...



73

00:08:35.208 --> 00:08:36.417

Drop it!



74

00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:42.792

Guard the ritual, Captain!



75

00:08:42.792 --> 00:08:45.417

Yeah, that's where I'll be!



76

00:08:45.917 --> 00:08:50.917

"Syringe" "A device Rod Reiss wants Historia Reiss

to use and transform into a Titan. It is believed to

use spinal fluid, and by injecting the transformation

serum, one is granted the inherent abilities of a Titan."



77

00:08:53.417 --> 00:08:56.375

It seems the enemy is nearby.



78

00:08:56.375 --> 00:08:58.250

Let's hurry, Historia.



79

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.458

Right.



80

00:09:05.292 --> 00:09:08.833

What, Eren? Why are you glaring?



81

00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:13.542

It's because... he has perceived his fate.



82

00:09:13.542 --> 00:09:18.833

That the stolen power will

return to where it belongs.



83

00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:20.750

Historia...



84

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.208

That means inside you.



85

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.542

Eh?



86

00:09:28.292 --> 00:09:36.125

This cavern... It was built around 100

years ago by the power of a certain Titan.



87

00:09:36.125 --> 00:09:40.167

Those three walls were built by the same power.



88

00:09:40.167 --> 00:09:45.042

By creating those enormous walls,

humanity was protected.



89

00:09:45.042 --> 00:09:53.250

The power of that Titan reached out to touch

people's hearts and alter their memories.



90

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:57.208

However, several bloodlines

were excluded from that.



91

00:09:57.208 --> 00:10:00.333

But their descendants and

the rest of humanity...



92

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:04.708

...retain no history of the

world past a century ago.



93

00:10:05.667 --> 00:10:09.875

Except for one, Frieda Reiss.



94

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:15.833

Frieda possessed more

than her power as a Titan.



95

00:10:15.833 --> 00:10:22.875

She knew how this world came about

and all the details behind it.



96

00:10:22.875 --> 00:10:28.542

She was 15 years old when

that knowledge became hers.



97

00:10:28.542 --> 00:10:32.125

Right here, eight years ago in this very place...



98

00:10:32.125 --> 00:10:37.708

...after she ate her uncle, my younger brother.



99

00:10:54.000 --> 00:11:00.708

Frieda inherited the Founding Titan

and the memories of this world.



100

00:11:00.708 --> 00:11:06.625

As had been done for 100 years,

repeated and passed through generations.



101

00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:12.417

Father...



102

00:11:13.542 --> 00:11:15.083

Yes...



103

00:11:15.083 --> 00:11:22.167

Basically, if Frieda had just used her power,

there wouldn't have been any problems.



104

00:11:22.167 --> 00:11:26.583

We might have eliminated Titans

from this world entirely.



105

00:11:26.583 --> 00:11:31.208

If only his father hadn't stolen

the power from her.



106

00:11:32.333 --> 00:11:36.583

Now, that power resides within Eren.



107

00:11:36.583 --> 00:11:38.417

However, that power...



108

00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:44.292

It can't truly manifest unless the blood

of the Reiss family runs through them.



109

00:11:44.292 --> 00:11:48.667

As long as he remains a vessel for that power...



110

00:11:48.667 --> 00:11:51.708

...this hell will forever continue.



111

00:11:51.708 --> 00:11:53.542

Eh?



112

00:11:53.542 --> 00:11:55.375

Then...



113

00:11:55.375 --> 00:11:58.000

Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!



114

00:11:59.375 --> 00:12:00.625

Kenny.



115

00:12:00.625 --> 00:12:06.125

So unless it's a Reiss who eats Eren,

they can't become a true King?



116

00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:07.750

That is correct.



117

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:14.083

Th-Then... even if I turn into a Titan

and eat Eren, it'll mean nothin'?



118

00:12:14.083 --> 00:12:15.375

What are you--?



119

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.250

Father!



120

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.917

Do you think I'm lying to you or something?



121

00:12:21.917 --> 00:12:23.583

Nope.



122

00:12:23.583 --> 00:12:30.167

I waited long for this day 'cuz I knew you

weren't lying about the succession ritual.



123

00:12:30.167 --> 00:12:31.708

For crying out loud!



124

00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:39.292

You used me this whole time knowing full well

what I was after, you sleazy playboy!



125

00:12:39.292 --> 00:12:41.208

I'm grateful for you.



126

00:12:41.208 --> 00:12:46.042

You may have been a stray dog that my

whimsical younger brother took in, but--



127

00:12:46.042 --> 00:12:51.458

Keep on insulting Uri, and you can

say goodbye to half of your head.



128

00:12:51.458 --> 00:12:53.333

Stop it!



129

00:12:53.333 --> 00:12:55.167

Let my father go!



130

00:12:56.833 --> 00:13:01.542

Huh? You're plain pitiful, Historia.



131

00:13:01.542 --> 00:13:03.792

Don't you get it?!



132

00:13:03.792 --> 00:13:10.125

This father of yours wants to turn you

into a monster and make you eat Eren.



133

00:13:16.375 --> 00:13:18.833

Because that's my duty.



134

00:13:20.458 --> 00:13:21.958

Yes...



135

00:13:21.958 --> 00:13:26.333

I'm going to eat Eren and bring my sister back.



136

00:13:26.333 --> 00:13:32.417

I'll inherit the world's history and

exterminate every last Titan!



137

00:13:32.417 --> 00:13:35.333

That's my duty!



138

00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:39.375

Hey, hey, Historia!



139

00:13:39.375 --> 00:13:43.292

Have you forgotten everything

this guy has done to you?



140

00:13:43.292 --> 00:13:47.167

The only thing he cares about

is the blood inside you.



141

00:13:47.167 --> 00:13:49.792

He doesn't wanna become a Titan himself!



142

00:13:49.792 --> 00:13:53.708

He's just trash that forces

his brother and daughter to!



143

00:13:53.708 --> 00:13:56.292

That's this father of yours!



144

00:13:58.875 --> 00:14:01.958

He's wrong, Historia...



145

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:05.667

I must not become a Titan myself.



146

00:14:05.667 --> 00:14:10.083

Do not believe... what anyone else says...



147

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.625

Oh, is that right?



148

00:14:15.625 --> 00:14:16.875

Father!



149

00:14:20.708 --> 00:14:22.375

Kenny.



150

00:14:22.375 --> 00:14:25.208

You've served well up until now.



151

00:14:25.208 --> 00:14:27.542

You're free now.



152

00:14:27.542 --> 00:14:32.458

Go find another purpose in life...

and live out your years.



153

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:40.083

That would bore me to death.



154

00:14:45.833 --> 00:14:49.500

Kenny! What are you doing?



155

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.583

Go ahead and turn into a Titan.



156

00:14:51.583 --> 00:14:54.125

I won't interfere anymore.



157

00:14:57.667 --> 00:15:00.667

However, no head starts.



158

00:15:02.042 --> 00:15:05.208

You both become Titans and have at it.



159

00:15:05.208 --> 00:15:08.917

If Historia wins, you'll have your peace.



160

00:15:08.917 --> 00:15:13.542

But if you lose to Eren,

the situation stays the same.



161

00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:20.583

Keep drawing breath till I run out and die?



162

00:15:20.583 --> 00:15:23.750

Can you even call that livin'?!



163

00:15:24.792 --> 00:15:26.500

Historia!



164

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.500

With this injection, you can

become a powerful Titan!



165

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:32.458

Then you can eat him,

but in fact, it's more than that!



166

00:15:32.458 --> 00:15:35.667

You must bite his spine

and consume the spinal fluid!



167

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.417

Whoops, better step back.



168

00:15:42.333 --> 00:15:44.458

Hurry up, Historia!



169

00:15:50.958 --> 00:15:53.042

Eren, why?!



170

00:15:53.042 --> 00:15:55.208

Why aren't you transforming?!



171

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:59.917

If I become a Titan, you'll get eaten!



172

00:15:59.917 --> 00:16:01.542

At this rate...



173

00:16:06.708 --> 00:16:09.875

Do it, Historia!



174

00:16:09.875 --> 00:16:12.792

It shouldn't have happened...



175

00:16:12.792 --> 00:16:14.583

Eh?



176

00:16:14.583 --> 00:16:16.375

Me...



177

00:16:16.375 --> 00:16:18.333

My dad, too...



178

00:16:19.333 --> 00:16:24.333

If five years ago, he hadn't done that here...



179

00:16:24.333 --> 00:16:30.000

Your sister... would have been

able to do something, right?



180

00:16:31.083 --> 00:16:35.292

But my dad stole the Power of

the Titans from its rightful place.



181

00:16:35.292 --> 00:16:39.042

Just how many died for that?



182

00:16:39.042 --> 00:16:40.792

Armin's grandpa...



183

00:16:40.792 --> 00:16:45.042

Thomas, Nack, Mina, Milieus...



184

00:16:45.042 --> 00:16:50.542

Marco... Those guys on Squad Levi...

The people of Stohess...



185

00:16:50.542 --> 00:16:53.458

Those soldiers who came to save me...



186

00:16:53.458 --> 00:16:55.125

Mr. Hannes...



187

00:16:56.417 --> 00:17:00.958

I can never atone for it all.



188

00:17:00.958 --> 00:17:03.792

It shouldn't have happened...



189

00:17:03.792 --> 00:17:06.792

Those days of training...



190

00:17:06.792 --> 00:17:10.250

That dream beyond the walls...



191

00:17:12.333 --> 00:17:16.375

I... shouldn't have happened.



192

00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:29.958

So, at the least...



193

00:17:29.958 --> 00:17:33.458

...let it end at your hand.



194

00:17:33.458 --> 00:17:35.958

Eat me.



195

00:17:35.958 --> 00:17:38.458

Save humanity.



196

00:17:42.458 --> 00:17:45.917

It's all... up to you.



197

00:17:53.542 --> 00:17:55.208

Eren...



198

00:17:55.208 --> 00:17:57.333

That time...



199

00:17:57.333 --> 00:18:02.292

...when you called me a normal

person, I was so happy.



200

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:12.208

So you're trying to do something "nice," huh?



201

00:18:18.375 --> 00:18:22.417

What's wrong, Historia? Are you scared?



202

00:18:22.417 --> 00:18:26.417

All you have to do is inject

that liquid into your body.



203

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.667

Father...



204

00:18:29.667 --> 00:18:31.750

Why?



205

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.750

Why didn't the Reiss family...

in that whole 100 years...



206

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:40.500

...eliminate the Titans and liberate humanity?



207

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:45.250

All while possessing the power

to control all the Titans...



208

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:54.083

Because, the first Reiss King who

built this world within the walls...



209

00:18:54.083 --> 00:18:58.500

...wished for us to be controlled by the Titans.



210

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:04.125

The first King believed that was

the only path to true peace.



211

00:19:04.125 --> 00:19:06.917

But I do not know why.



212

00:19:06.917 --> 00:19:10.125

It's only known by those who

see the world's memories.



213

00:19:11.542 --> 00:19:13.708

Long ago, I...



214

00:19:13.708 --> 00:19:18.292

...along with my brother, pleaded with our

father to free humanity from the Titans...



215

00:19:18.292 --> 00:19:21.208

...time and time again.



216

00:19:21.208 --> 00:19:26.125

However, he would not fulfill our wish.



217

00:19:26.125 --> 00:19:30.833

Eventually, it came time for

my father to pass on that role.



218

00:19:30.833 --> 00:19:34.792

When my brother inherited the Power of

the Titans and I looked into his eyes...



219

00:19:34.792 --> 00:19:37.250

...I understood what that meant.



220

00:19:38.458 --> 00:19:43.333

To create this world...

To govern its very foundation...



221

00:19:43.333 --> 00:19:49.000

To be an omnipotent being

is to be what my brother became.



222

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:52.042

Do you know what we call that?



223

00:19:53.125 --> 00:19:55.083

God.



224

00:19:55.083 --> 00:19:59.292

What we call that... is God.



225

00:19:59.292 --> 00:20:05.625

And my duty is to bring God back to

our world and offer them my prayers.



226

00:20:05.625 --> 00:20:08.542

I'm praying, Historia.



227

00:20:08.542 --> 00:20:12.458

For God to lead and guide humanity!



228

00:20:14.958 --> 00:20:16.917

Christa.



229

00:20:16.917 --> 00:20:22.167

I have no right to tell you

how to live your life.



230

00:20:22.167 --> 00:20:27.250

So actually, this is nothing more

than a hope of mine...



231

00:20:30.792 --> 00:20:34.250

I want you... to live a life you're proud of.



232

00:20:48.042 --> 00:20:50.250

Historia!



233

00:20:54.833 --> 00:21:00.375

God, my ass! You're just giving yourself

an out and manipulating other people!



234

00:21:00.375 --> 00:21:04.333

I've had it! I won't let you kill me!



235

00:21:10.458 --> 00:21:14.375

That's the spirit! This is gettin' good!



236

00:21:16.042 --> 00:21:18.500

What are you doing, Historia?!



237

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.958

Eren, we're leaving.



238

00:21:19.958 --> 00:21:21.958

Hey, stop it!



239

00:21:21.958 --> 00:21:25.125

If I go on living, everyone will keep suffering!



240

00:21:25.125 --> 00:21:27.125

Hurry up and eat me!



241

00:21:27.125 --> 00:21:29.417

I can't take living like this!



242

00:21:29.417 --> 00:21:33.208

Shut up, idiot! Just shut up, crybaby!



243

00:21:35.167 --> 00:21:39.458

Exterminate the Titans?!

Who the hell wants to do that bullshit?!



244

00:21:39.458 --> 00:21:41.667

I'm starting to hate humanity!



245

00:21:41.667 --> 00:21:44.167

Let 'em get wiped out by Titans!



246

00:21:44.167 --> 00:21:46.750

I'm humanity's biggest enemy!



247

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:50.583

Got it?! I'm the worst girl who ever lived!



248

00:21:52.125 --> 00:21:54.000

You escape from here.



249

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.542

I'll destroy everything else!



250

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.833

Father...



251

00:22:01.833 --> 00:22:03.625

Uri...



252

00:22:03.625 --> 00:22:05.625

Frieda...



253

00:22:05.625 --> 00:22:07.333

Wait for me...



254

00:22:07.333 --> 00:22:10.917

I'll... now...



255

00:23:57.417 --> 00:24:00.625

Rod Reiss becomes a Titan.



256

00:24:00.625 --> 00:24:08.292

To protect Mikasa and the others from a cave-in,

Eren is cornered by another decision.



257

00:24:08.292 --> 00:24:12.096

Next episode: "Outside the

Walls of Orvud District."

